# Stack and conventions

- Node.js LTS, Vite, React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, npm
- Conventional Commits: `feat|fix|docs|chore|refactor|test|ci: imperative subject`
- Functional components, semantic HTML, no unexplained `any`
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, or `node_modules`
- Review AI output; verify UI changes in the browser
- Keep diffs focused on one concern per commit
